google-services.json
**/google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
firebase_app_id_file.json
**/firebase_app_id_file.json

# Assinatura de Apps (Keystores e Certificados)
key.properties
**/key.properties
key.properties.json
**/key.properties.json
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pem
*.key
*.cert
*.der

